seems like faulty hardware. check cable and its termination. ncr53c8xx is 
not very strict about termination (I've been accidentally using it
while having 1 or 3 terminators in same cable and have had only slight
problems :-) so it just might work a little bit with faulty cabling or
termination. 

do you have only internal scsi devices? is there terminator installed
to external scsi connector (the mini-50 one) on back of the box? there 
should be. 

next thing is to check for different devices by unplugging them one
at time and seeing of the problems goes away.

sometimes it is just painful :-(

--
antti


